        3120,
        6480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 896,
        "content": "## Monitor competitor prices on DoorDash and Instacart with Apify and Google Sheets\n\n### Who's it for\n\nRestaurant chains and multi-location operators that need to see what nearby competitors charge on delivery platforms. Brand-wide averages hide what a customer actually sees, so this template pulls prices per location and per search term.\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow is manually triggered, then generates a list of location and keyword combinations to research. It loops through each combination, runs an Apify scrape for competitor listings, attaches the originating search context, reduces the returned listing data to key fields, and writes the results to Google Sheets.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure Apify credentials and verify the Apify actor/input used by the scraping node is set up for the desired marketplace or search source.\n- Configure Google Sheets credentials and select the target spreadsheet, sheet, and append/write operation.\n- Edit the code node that defines locations and keywords so it contains the search locations and terms you want to monitor.\n- Confirm the Set nodes map the expected Apify response fields, especially name, price, currency, location, keyword, and search location.\n\n### Customization\n\nCustomize the location and keyword list, Apify actor parameters, batch size/loop behavior, and the Google Sheet columns to match the competitor data you want to track."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "14b2714b-d96a-4174-9475-b281926193bf",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        3680,
        7104
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 512,
        "height": 384,
        "content": "## Start and define searches\n\nManually starts the workflow and prepares the initial list of locations and keywords that will be processed."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "3b655db3-88a7-494a-b93f-45be98c83d47",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        4128,
        6480
